_2710374385793731_4335129908217143921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bzQ7_lLuSHMQ7kNvwF5b1WU&_nc_oc=AdqRIHQqTnMMGZ2824c0eP_uevS8gFTCEJxXNZtKJNk8hI2byJmpx3SSGTk-8at4j0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE4DgGYGDJFXImXSrPOr2_w7QthzUwSCh20Bdg_ndaaVA&oe=6A81C0DE"}, {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "1819549741885168", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984474_1819549745218501_878499352484891744_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RrCWEI8Qk8wQ7kNvwHw30i5&_nc_oc=Adrs39leNrGllIlEsV-d61oMTcZCH2nswK_cQTK-_itW8QNSjVVSYsDslcPwtGemtWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGM52p96VHSTAtxWbGQX6DURui504SL3JKq9DqLX5ZkyA&oe=6A8196AD"}, {"file_name": "002.png", "id": "790364216531353", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974483_790364219864686_8155488325575676486_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0mtdWvCmAbUQ7kNvwHvP1BV&_nc_oc=AdoxbLEv6ksJaQYIPjlL4_rjLZ4py_b_3wklhD2f0m5uAX8qDo5t628RqGjPHHMOJVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-mxf46lg7ODxn_QFgIBFKbjzuy0OQXgLygMqJs-SJig&oe=6A81AEEC"}, {"file_name": "001.png", "id": "1205543714149528", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75269591_1205543717482861_1636873667456873713_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kRu_dNqlOPAQ7kNvwEr8Whf&_nc_oc=AdqZmnPIWr2myN_LqprR5va01F4ifi_K_wOFVqjGT4qYVnYyFE-XgTKFfosxTGjBzFM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFdjRbi2IFcYZq2moEB0DbiY5_LU4nilAPE0Maz4bRgHw&oe=6A81B6B4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "476707408073775", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75294244_476707411407108_5418331704720470775_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ITUrgpZi9oUQ7kNvwEGVgMH&_nc_oc=AdoSHa0DsbgCnWK14t5ig0xPnQ_EAHZuDTLvACEq5145RyFj58lIq-wsVTXyddpbMXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGz0VKZqPjWdXBbPyw6hn24IoWJIF63Uvw9cwRKM14qpw&oe=6A81A6B8"}, "display_name": "Virnect View", "keywords": ["virnect", "view", "ar", "industry", "virnectview"], "long_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency with VIRNECT View.\n\nEasily augment manuals on actual equipment to confirm equipment usage.\n\nCheck real-time field data and operate processes efficiently.\n\nShorten training time for new employees by utilizing realistic educational content.\n\n[Main Features]\n\nSpatial-based AR Content Visualization\nAllows for more accurate problem confirmation than paper manuals\n\nOffline Environment Support\nDownload AR content to your device for easy access even in offline environments.\n\nReal-time Data Monitoring\nConnects data information to content for direct on-site viewing.\n\nWork Result Report Writing\nCreate reports while viewing AR content.\n(Supports text input, photo capture, and checklist-style work reporting)\n\nImmersive Content\nProvides a more immersive content experience through various animations and interaction functions.\n\n[Access Permission Guide]\n\nIf necessary access is not allowed, there may be restrictions on service usage.\n\n[Open Source License Guide]\n\nIn-App Information Notification\n\n[Customer Support Center]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/support/inquiry\n\n[Website]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/\n\nThis is an enterprise app. Please purchase licenses from the payment center (web) to use.", "short_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency by using VIRNECT View.\n\nYou can easily check how to use the equipment by augmenting the manual on the actual equipment.\n\nSee real-time field data and operate the process efficiently.\n\nTraining time for new employees can be shortened by using realistic educational content."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://console.virnect.com/legal?type=policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://console.virnect.com/l